  "id": "homophily",
  "term": "homophily",
  "definition": "Homophily is the perceived similarity between people, such as feeling that another person shares one’s values, lifestyle, or identity-related characteristics. In social relationships, stronger homophily reflects a stronger sense that “we are alike,” which can support closer bonds.",
